{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Checkout Midnight</strong> is an atmospheric horror game. At night, you work in a supermarket: serving customers, checking IDs for alcohol purchases, counting change, and trying to follow the rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/gif1.gif?t=1751314351\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But then another shift begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/gif3.gif?t=1751314351\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At some point, the lights start flickering, and you hear strange noises all around. Something is clearly wrong with this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/gif2.gif?t=1751314351\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supermarket work simulation</strong> \u2013 Routine cashier tasks: customers, goods, money, penalties for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric retro graphics</strong> \u2013 A retro-style visual design that enhances the eerie and immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark story</strong> \u2013 Uncover the secrets of the mysterious supermarket and its staff.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754260?t=1751314351","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754260?t=1751314351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/dc872ceea2c7d5db1bac7bfd3eed75440cea8b23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751314351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/dc872ceea2c7d5db1bac7bfd3eed75440cea8b23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751314351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Checkout Midnight</strong> is an atmospheric horror game. At night, you work in a supermarket: serving customers, checking IDs for alcohol purchases, counting change, and trying to follow the rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/gif1.gif?t=1751314351\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But then another shift begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/gif3.gif?t=1751314351\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At some point, the lights start flickering, and you hear strange noises all around. Something is clearly wrong with this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754260/extras/gif2.gif?t=1751314351\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supermarket work simulation</strong> \u2013 Routine cashier tasks: customers, goods, money, penalties for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric retro graphics</strong> \u2013 A retro-style visual design that enhances the eerie and immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark story</strong> \u2013 Uncover the secrets of the mysterious supermarket and its staff.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Regtape"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descri